{"version":1,"key":"card:465","content":{"id":465,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd3ce8b4-300b-49c7-a527-44b2d4fc65a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Python 使用异常对象来表示异常状态，并在遇到错误时引发异常。异常对象未被处理（或捕获）时，程序将终止并显示一条错误消息。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"8ee23fab-3b48-4a9d-ab8d-730c5de2096f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7401fb02-9fa3-46bf-a35f-470364fde733","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> 1 / 0\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nZeroDivisionError: integer division or modulo by zero","collabId":"e0353ef9-f278-4353-bd8a-98d36961ea95","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63f26cad-0e0e-46ba-a7ee-29a9e4a00468","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每个异常都是某个类（这里是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ZeroDivisionError"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）的实例。你能以各种方式引发和捕获这些实例，从而逮住错误并采取措施，而不是放任整个程序失败。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"37a34376-ebd6-4576-89d8-b5a3ba631ea1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要引发异常，可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"raise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句，并将一个类（必须是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Exception"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的子类）或实例作为参数。将类作为参数时，将自动创建一个实例。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"09c9ed0d-cb63-4785-bfaa-f2c765bd1442","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bb49cf2f-917d-4582-a1d3-9d922e1656e6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> raise Exception\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nException\n\n>>> raise Exception('hyperdrive overload')\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nException: hyperdrive overload","collabId":"efb84d8c-5993-43a2-923d-fc1145786db2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66e4c9cc-345a-4dd8-aecb-c610b267fee8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有很多内置的异常类，这些异常类都可用于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"raise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_806439bc-49a5-4b87-862a-1e046fd9c053.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"cdbd512f-3887-456c-b112-8b48fdeb98a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"2b989e0f-5d9e-4b93-8e7b-7e4ae55d6dd2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9716d3a-1c85-4590-89cf-00d7bf13c342","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然内置异常涉及的范围很广，能够满足很多需求，但有时你可能想自己创建异常类。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"de013c78-fd97-4ff3-b827-c1dc0ceccd00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么如何创建异常类呢？就像创建其他类一样，但务必直接或间接地继承 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Exception"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（这意味着从任何内置异常类派生都可以）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"60ec6360-38c1-4747-bd59-4aa9be694ca3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不处理函数中引发的异常，它将向上传播到调用函数的地方。如果在那里也未得到处理，异常将继续传播，直至到达主程序（全局作用域）。如果主程序中也没有异常处理程序，程序将终止并显示栈跟踪消息。"}]}],"tags":["Python/异常"],"createTime":1719226474617,"updateTime":1791474923036,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923036}}